<section class="section section--white" id="sdn" aria-labelledby="sdn-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row row--reverse">
			<div class="row__text">
				<p class="eyebrow">SDN appliance</p>
				<h2 id="sdn-heading">Solve difficult customer networks with the SDN appliance.</h2>
				<p class="lede">Many SIP deployments fail at the customer edge: NAT behavior, SIP ALG, UDP timers, firewall restrictions, one-way audio, registration instability, or RTP pinhole issues. The VoiceTel SDN appliance sits inside the customer LAN and establishes a secure tunnel to VoiceTel, so PBX registrations and media flows avoid them, with fewer multi-day troubleshooting cycles for you.</p>
				<div class="cta-row">
					<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/sdn/">SDN appliance details</a>
				</div>
			</div>
